    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Doll Sitter",
    "steam_appid": 2234380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/02c95341851c8726e192cd2d37f1180c.poster.avif?t=1746537210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/02c95341851c8726e192cd2d37f1180c.webm?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>The Doll Sitter</strong> \u2014 a psychological horror game where you play as a nanny caring for dolls in a strange and terrifying house. <br>Explore the environment, watch over the dolls, and figure out which one is the imposter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8e <strong>Take Care of the Dolls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Feed them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udec1 Wash and dress them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf5 Find damage and repair it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Read them stories and help them fall asleep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/45e11c1fc5a7867abd5c39dfd97e7f91.poster.avif?t=1746537210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/45e11c1fc5a7867abd5c39dfd97e7f91.webm?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/45e11c1fc5a7867abd5c39dfd97e7f91.mp4?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Imposter</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Explore the environment and collect clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Examine the dolls for anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3 Interrogate the other dolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Use tools like a UV flashlight, radio, or camera to reveal what\u2019s hidden</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/662986abf8b177f618fe587f36c7fe3e.poster.avif?t=1746537210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/662986abf8b177f618fe587f36c7fe3e.webm?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0fOnce you've gathered enough evidence and you're sure which doll is the impostor, lock it in the chest \u2014 but remember, a mistake will cost you your life.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/02c95341851c8726e192cd2d37f1180c.poster.avif?t=1746537210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/02c95341851c8726e192cd2d37f1180c.webm?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>The Doll Sitter</strong> \u2014 a psychological horror game where you play as a nanny caring for dolls in a strange and terrifying house. <br>Explore the environment, watch over the dolls, and figure out which one is the imposter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf8e <strong>Take Care of the Dolls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Feed them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udec1 Wash and dress them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf5 Find damage and repair it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Read them stories and help them fall asleep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/45e11c1fc5a7867abd5c39dfd97e7f91.poster.avif?t=1746537210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/45e11c1fc5a7867abd5c39dfd97e7f91.webm?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/45e11c1fc5a7867abd5c39dfd97e7f91.mp4?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Imposter</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Explore the environment and collect clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41 Examine the dolls for anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde3 Interrogate the other dolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 Use tools like a UV flashlight, radio, or camera to reveal what\u2019s hidden</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/662986abf8b177f618fe587f36c7fe3e.poster.avif?t=1746537210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2234380/extras/662986abf8b177f618fe587f36c7fe3e.webm?t=1746537210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0fOnce you've gathered enough evidence and you're sure which doll is the impostor, lock it in the chest \u2014 but remember, a mistake will cost you your life.</p></li></ul>",
